  STATIC SimpleDateFormat shared across CXF worker threads. Under concurrency
  this field has been observed to contain interleaved garbage. The
  characterization harness must normalise it AND should assert it parses.

  auditXml is built by string concatenation in
  ResponseShaper.buildSummitAuditXml. Note that the hold CODE is escaped and
  the hold REASON is not.
-->
